  "description": "“If I were to suddenly pass away… would you look after my family for me?”\n\nFor the sake of my beloved best friend, I married her husband. It was the final wish of my one and only true friend in this world. To protect the two children she left behind, I became their stepmother.\n\nEnduring the deep resentment of her sons and the harsh, judging glares of society, I spent seven long years in a contract marriage just to fulfill that promise. But the moment the children came of age, I walked away without a single shred of regret—exactly as agreed.\n\nJust as I was finally setting out to live life on my own terms, completely unexpected people began appearing before me.\nThe Third Prince, who vanished without a trace seven years ago; my first love, whom I haven’t forgotten for a single day; and even my ex-husband and stepsons, who are only now realizing what they’ve lost…!\n\n***Note:** This series was pre-released in Japan, despite being a Korean work.*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69522914), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%83%88%EC%97%84%EB%A7%88%EA%B0%80-%EB%96%A0%EB%82%AC%EB%8B%A4/4894)\n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[Japanese](https://piccoma.com/web/product/201602)",
